ative/Podfile.lock verified semantically unchanged by canonicalization\n  (byte-identical to its pre-existing committed content).\n- lock-review.json hashes recomputed over canonical inputs with the production\n  hasher semantics: gemLockSha256 now binds the checksum-bearing lock.\n  podfileSha256 unchanged by design (input is the macOS prebuild artifact,\n  untouched by this chain).\n- validate-locks.rb hardened: File.binwrite for canonical output — Windows\n  text mode would emit CRLF and make canonical bytes platform-dependent,\n  which the hash binding cannot tolerate.\n- Verification is byte-stable: canonical roundtrip reproduces the committed\n  bytes exactly on this Windows host, and LF binwrite matches macOS.","timestamp":"2026-11-25T13:25:04Z","author":{"name":"HYJ1817","email":"hyjsb1817@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"HYJ1817","email":"hyjsb1817@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1465689328,"node_id":"R_kgDOV1yk8A","name":"pi-gui-ios","full_name":"HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios","private":false,"owner":{"login":"HYJ1817","id":173616370,"node_id":"U_kgDOClks8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173616370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817","html_url":"https://github.com/HYJ1817","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios","description":"iOS